      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 94703,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764985540333332
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you. Let me pull that up... I see the Urban Commuter Helmet, delivered on October 18th. To understand the situation, is it a technical fault with the helmet or more of a preference issue?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
