      "user_id": 94703,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764985589466662
    },
    {
      "text": "I've just emailed a prepaid return label to the address on file. You can just print that out, attach it to the shipping box, and drop it off at any postal service location. Once we receive it, your refund will be processed.",
